Unless you state otherwise, a contribution you send in is dual licensed as above, with no
additional terms.

## The data and the thumbnails

`data.json` and `static/thumbnails.jpg` -- and every build artifact carrying them, including
`dist/` and the apk -- are derived from [yume.wiki](https://yume.wiki) and are licensed
[CC BY-NC-SA 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode), the wiki's own
terms. So: attribution to the wiki, no commercial use, and anything built out of them carries the
same licence.

See [ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md](ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md).
